WEBVTT

01:33.410 --> 01:35.380
(Adapted from the web novel "Waiting for You in a City")

01:35.451 --> 01:37.880
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:37.951 --> 01:40.821
(Episode 30)

01:41.121 --> 01:42.220
Hello, excuse me.

02:13.351 --> 02:14.520
Please enjoy.

02:17.821 --> 02:18.661
Try it.

02:20.590 --> 02:21.531
Mr. Meng?

02:21.890 --> 02:22.661
Mr. Meng.

02:23.661 --> 02:25.360
Why didn't you tell me you're eating here?

02:25.430 --> 02:26.701
That's not right.

02:26.900 --> 02:28.731
It just so happens that my company is having a reception here.

02:28.800 --> 02:29.731
I came to take a look.

02:29.900 --> 02:31.501
Otherwise, I wouldn't have bumped into you.

02:31.571 --> 02:32.770
It's not that I didn't want to say hi,

02:33.270 --> 02:34.340
you're just too busy.

02:34.870 --> 02:36.370
I didn't expect that you'd be here today.

02:36.810 --> 02:38.840
If I knew I'd be disturbing you,

02:39.110 --> 02:40.080
I wouldn't have come.

02:40.441 --> 02:42.511
That sounds too distant.

02:44.050 --> 02:44.881
Who's this?

02:45.550 --> 02:46.520
My friend's sister.

02:46.751 --> 02:47.821
She's studying in Yancheng.

02:48.020 --> 02:48.951
I'm treating her to a meal.

02:50.691 --> 02:52.490
No wonder she looks so young.

02:52.990 --> 02:53.791
Mr. Meng.

02:54.520 --> 02:56.191
You're such a busy man.

02:56.490 --> 02:57.791
I've been asking to meet you since last year.

02:57.860 --> 02:59.430
I have yet to have a meal with you.

03:01.531 --> 03:03.101
People are watching me.

03:03.300 --> 03:04.171
No matter what I do,

03:04.300 --> 03:05.800
I have to work harder.

03:06.270 --> 03:07.240
I understand.

03:08.270 --> 03:10.441
Since we met today,

03:10.671 --> 03:12.310
I'll take a few minutes of your time.

03:12.511 --> 03:13.781
Let's get the business talk over with.

03:14.851 --> 03:16.511
You don't mind, do you?

03:19.851 --> 03:21.490
What business do you want to talk about?

03:22.421 --> 03:24.691
It's a confirmed profitable business.

03:24.751 --> 03:26.590
I have all the resources at hand.

03:26.661 --> 03:28.261
It's a multi-channel network incubation company.

03:28.691 --> 03:29.830
Platform manufacturing,

03:29.890 --> 03:31.701
plastic surgery hospital, micro-loan company.

03:31.761 --> 03:33.501
All in one.

03:34.031 --> 03:34.761
Look.

03:34.900 --> 03:36.501
Young girls nowadays...

03:36.571 --> 03:37.430
all want to be influencers.

03:37.900 --> 03:39.071
We'll sign them up.

03:39.171 --> 03:41.171
The girl can sell merchandise...

03:41.240 --> 03:43.340
and also be a client of the plastic surgery hospital.

03:43.471 --> 03:44.541
She can even get a loan.

03:44.610 --> 03:45.710
We earn in every aspect.

03:46.411 --> 03:47.210
What do you think?

03:50.881 --> 03:51.951
Do you think this business...

03:53.221 --> 03:53.951
is profitable?

03:55.620 --> 03:56.821
It's profitable, isn't it?

04:02.090 --> 04:03.291
Objectively speaking,

04:03.360 --> 04:04.691
it's quite profitable indeed.

04:04.900 --> 04:06.400
But subjectively,

04:07.701 --> 04:08.900
it's immoral.

04:10.330 --> 04:12.671
The word you used...

04:13.171 --> 04:14.340
is not right.

04:14.840 --> 04:16.340
This is the current phenomenon.

04:16.870 --> 04:17.971
If we don't do it,

04:18.240 --> 04:19.710
it will still be happening.

04:19.781 --> 04:20.981
Business is business.

04:21.110 --> 04:22.680
Why not make money?

04:23.810 --> 04:24.680
Mr. Liu.

04:24.950 --> 04:26.281
Your upbringing is different from mine.

04:26.421 --> 04:27.820
If I do it,

04:27.880 --> 04:29.221
my father...

04:29.291 --> 04:30.291
will break my legs.

04:31.320 --> 04:32.521
Upbringing?

04:40.130 --> 04:41.260
The bill is on me.

04:41.331 --> 04:42.331
You don't have to pay.

04:42.831 --> 04:43.700
Mr. Meng...

04:43.771 --> 04:45.401
has already settled the bill.

04:51.240 --> 04:52.081
Enjoy.

05:00.450 --> 05:01.351
Dig in.

05:07.891 --> 05:09.161
Actually, I think...

05:09.391 --> 05:10.490
you're a nice person.

05:13.130 --> 05:14.300
Isn't that the basics?

05:15.130 --> 05:16.731
But other businessmen...

05:16.800 --> 05:18.370
can't even do the basics.

05:19.171 --> 05:20.800
What do other people have to do with me?

05:25.041 --> 05:26.610
You're doing all this...

05:28.010 --> 05:29.610
to remind me, right?

05:30.180 --> 05:31.281
You're overthinking it.

05:34.081 --> 05:35.490
Let's say I'm overthinking it.

05:36.891 --> 05:37.651
Then...

05:37.820 --> 05:40.360
I'll make peace with my face for now.

05:45.961 --> 05:48.500
(Xu Qin)

05:50.331 --> 05:51.231
I have something urgent to do.

05:51.370 --> 05:52.101
I have to go.

05:52.171 --> 05:53.341
Eat before you go.

05:53.740 --> 05:55.541
I'm sorry. It's important.

06:14.990 --> 06:15.661
Yan Chen.

06:17.391 --> 06:18.601
You're here already?

06:19.101 --> 06:20.300
I happened to be nearby.

06:20.500 --> 06:21.731
This is the medicine for Mom and Dad.

06:21.800 --> 06:23.000
The dosage is written here.

06:24.800 --> 06:26.771
Dad took your car for maintenance.

06:29.841 --> 06:30.841
How have you been?

06:31.610 --> 06:32.440
I'm good.

06:32.781 --> 06:33.510
Really?

06:34.810 --> 06:35.481
Really.

06:36.310 --> 06:37.081
That's good then.

06:39.151 --> 06:39.950
By the way,

06:40.880 --> 06:42.050
you don't have a car anymore.

06:42.250 --> 06:43.221
How do you go to work every day?

06:44.490 --> 06:45.521
Me? I take the subway.

06:46.190 --> 06:47.860
Their house is so far from the subway station.

06:48.391 --> 06:49.331
How do you get there?

06:49.391 --> 06:50.860
I've been learning how to ride a bike.

06:51.560 --> 06:52.700
You're biking...

06:53.401 --> 06:54.360
in this cold weather?

06:54.601 --> 06:55.731
I have gloves and a scarf.

06:55.800 --> 06:56.901
I'm not afraid of the cold.

06:59.740 --> 07:00.641
Is this...

07:01.641 --> 07:02.841
the life he can give you?

07:03.010 --> 07:04.370
What's wrong with this kind of life?

07:06.641 --> 07:07.810
If you face any difficulties...

07:08.310 --> 07:09.450
but you don't want to tell Mom and Dad,

07:10.081 --> 07:11.050
you can tell me.

07:11.581 --> 07:12.750
I won't snitch on you.

07:14.081 --> 07:14.880
I know.

07:15.320 --> 07:16.151
Don't worry, Yan Chen.

07:16.351 --> 07:17.250
You should go back.

07:17.421 --> 07:18.320
I'll get going.

07:18.490 --> 07:19.760
Remember to remind Mom and Dad to take their medicine.

07:37.240 --> 07:37.940
Mom.

07:39.281 --> 07:40.211
You're back.

07:47.521 --> 07:48.490
This is...

07:49.021 --> 07:50.721
the medicine Qin Qin got for you and Dad.

07:51.521 --> 07:52.661
The dosage...

07:52.760 --> 07:53.891
is written here.

07:58.800 --> 07:59.560
I'm going upstairs.

08:16.510 --> 08:17.250
Mom.

08:19.120 --> 08:20.651
Qin Qin has grown up.

08:21.651 --> 08:23.320
She has her own life to live.

08:23.651 --> 08:25.050
Just let her be.

08:31.091 --> 08:32.300
Our family...

08:33.300 --> 08:34.760
has spoiled her too much.

08:35.570 --> 08:36.901
She has become too willful.

08:39.240 --> 08:41.141
She can be willful about other things.

08:41.840 --> 08:43.340
I can give in to her.

08:43.771 --> 08:44.840
But in this matter,

08:45.381 --> 08:46.080
I can't.

08:47.180 --> 08:47.881
Mom.

08:48.480 --> 08:49.980
Why are you doing this?

08:51.180 --> 08:52.050
When she was younger,

08:52.320 --> 08:53.450
you could stop her.

08:53.521 --> 08:54.950
But she's all grown up now.

08:55.050 --> 08:55.950
She's independent.

08:56.050 --> 08:57.621
She has her own thoughts.

08:57.690 --> 08:59.190
Why do you have to control her?

09:04.391 --> 09:05.200
Yan Chen.

09:06.600 --> 09:08.300
Are you talking about her...

09:08.631 --> 09:10.001
or you?

09:15.541 --> 09:17.171
There's nothing I'm not satisfied with.

09:19.310 --> 09:20.381
Kids.

09:21.781 --> 09:22.911
When they don't get a toy,

09:22.980 --> 09:24.011
they'll make a fuss.

09:25.011 --> 09:25.881
When they do,

09:26.281 --> 09:28.151
they'll only play with it for a short while.

09:31.021 --> 09:32.361
What kind of family is that?

09:32.761 --> 09:34.121
I can't let this happen.

09:37.891 --> 09:38.830
Soon,

09:39.300 --> 09:40.901
she'll find out what kind of person he is...

09:41.361 --> 09:43.100
and come back home.

09:43.531 --> 09:44.970
I have the patience to wait.

09:46.871 --> 09:47.800
You guys...

09:48.001 --> 09:49.171
should listen to your parents.

09:49.771 --> 09:50.570
After all,

09:51.011 --> 09:52.580
they have experienced more than you.

09:52.641 --> 09:53.411
And they know...

09:53.781 --> 09:55.180
more than you do.

10:04.050 --> 10:05.320
I'm going upstairs.

10:23.210 --> 10:24.271
Hello, Mom.

10:25.411 --> 10:26.111
Come back...

10:26.381 --> 10:27.580
and go shopping with me.

10:27.980 --> 10:29.881
Then have dinner at home.

10:30.310 --> 10:31.111
I...

10:31.710 --> 10:33.121
I'll go back later.

10:47.560 --> 10:53.300
(I can't spend the weekend with you anymore.)

11:28.600 --> 11:29.340
Hello?

11:29.771 --> 11:31.041
Hello, Song Yan.

11:31.210 --> 11:32.041
Are you busy?

11:32.881 --> 11:33.611
What's up?

11:33.680 --> 11:35.881
Nothing. I just feel sorry for you.

11:36.580 --> 11:38.050
You have a pitiful dating life.

11:38.111 --> 11:38.881
You're so lonely.

11:39.480 --> 11:41.281
Xu Qin is off this weekend.

11:41.350 --> 11:42.690
Why didn't she come home?

11:42.820 --> 11:44.151
She went to her parents' place.

11:44.521 --> 11:46.491
Her parents definitely didn't let her spend the weekend with you.

11:47.460 --> 11:48.391
What can I do?

11:48.861 --> 11:49.991
They're her parents after all.

11:51.690 --> 11:53.361
Couldn't she go back tomorrow?

11:53.430 --> 11:55.161
You only see her once a week.

11:55.371 --> 11:57.131
You finally got a day off today...

11:57.401 --> 11:58.871
and have to go back to the team tomorrow.

11:59.470 --> 12:01.501
If you don't spend more time together now,

12:01.570 --> 12:02.671
it'll be another week before you meet again.

12:02.871 --> 12:04.511
You finally got to be lovey-dovey...

12:04.570 --> 12:05.881
and now you have to cool down again?

12:06.810 --> 12:08.611
Did you two fight?

12:09.580 --> 12:10.310
No.

12:10.980 --> 12:12.350
Then she's bored of you...

12:12.421 --> 12:13.180
and wants to dump you.

12:14.550 --> 12:15.690
Don't talk nonsense.

12:17.151 --> 12:19.161
I don't believe that you're not panicking.

12:19.291 --> 12:20.291
You're talking too much.

12:20.891 --> 12:22.460
You must be quite free.

12:22.531 --> 12:23.330
Where are you?

12:23.491 --> 12:24.330
Come and work.

12:25.361 --> 12:26.501
I'll be home later.

12:29.200 --> 12:31.401
You're good at giving me work.

12:31.901 --> 12:33.440
I shouldn't have pitied you.

13:51.111 --> 13:52.820
Mrs. and Ms. Meng, welcome.

13:53.080 --> 13:53.850
Please follow me.

13:55.891 --> 13:56.720
This way.

14:01.161 --> 14:03.391
Last weekend, we got a new collection.

14:03.460 --> 14:04.891
We've been saving it for you.

14:05.131 --> 14:07.230
Many customers have been asking for it.

14:07.300 --> 14:09.430
But our manager specifically told us to let you choose first.

14:09.531 --> 14:10.800
See if you like any.

14:11.901 --> 14:13.771
These are all the latest styles.

14:13.840 --> 14:15.070
See which one you like.

14:15.141 --> 14:16.771
I'll get a model to try it on for you.

14:25.850 --> 14:26.550
Is there more?

14:26.820 --> 14:27.820
Yes. Hold on.

14:27.881 --> 14:29.121
- Change it. - Okay.

14:36.190 --> 14:37.131
Hold on.

14:46.200 --> 14:48.070
Song Yan, where's my doughnut?

14:50.671 --> 14:51.470
Thank you, Song Yan.

14:52.710 --> 14:53.511
Wait.

14:53.580 --> 14:55.440
Who is the bag you're holding for?

14:57.980 --> 14:59.350
- It's for you... - Thank you, Song Yan.

14:59.421 --> 15:00.220
Your sister-in-law.

15:00.881 --> 15:01.751
How could you?

15:01.820 --> 15:03.251
You're prioritizing a girl over your sibling.

15:04.651 --> 15:05.450
Today,

15:05.761 --> 15:07.761
if I don't see her before I get back to work,

15:08.261 --> 15:09.531
give this to her for me.

15:10.891 --> 15:13.330
Is your box of doughnuts as expensive as gold?

15:18.830 --> 15:19.641
What's the matter?

15:19.800 --> 15:21.141
Are you rewarding me...

15:21.200 --> 15:22.411
because I helped you a lot recently?

15:23.371 --> 15:25.470
Why would a child wear lipstick?

15:26.541 --> 15:27.210
Look at you.

15:27.281 --> 15:28.980
You've completely changed now that you have a girlfriend.

15:29.050 --> 15:30.050
You're only thinking about her.

15:30.111 --> 15:31.611
Am I adopted or what?

15:32.850 --> 15:33.621
What's wrong?

15:33.751 --> 15:35.621
Do you need me to help you pick?

15:35.690 --> 15:37.891
We girls know girls well.

15:40.690 --> 15:41.460
Forget it.

15:42.491 --> 15:43.190
Hello.

15:43.960 --> 15:45.391
Do you want to buy a lipstick?

15:46.100 --> 15:48.131
I'll take all of these.

15:48.300 --> 15:49.100
Okay.

15:50.700 --> 15:51.600
Song Yan.

15:52.401 --> 15:54.641
I must really be adopted.

15:55.070 --> 15:56.241
How could you treat me like this?

15:56.671 --> 15:57.541
I want one too.

15:58.340 --> 15:59.381
Where do I pay?

16:00.041 --> 16:01.241
You! Stop right there.

16:04.881 --> 16:05.720
Mrs. Meng.

16:05.820 --> 16:07.320
You have good taste.

16:07.720 --> 16:08.850
Tomorrow, we'll have someone...

16:09.021 --> 16:11.891
to deliver your purchase personally.

16:12.090 --> 16:12.820
Thank you.

16:12.891 --> 16:13.960
It's okay. It's what I should do.

16:14.261 --> 16:15.261
Thank you for your patronage.

16:15.320 --> 16:16.361
Take care.

16:20.230 --> 16:21.800
You're trying to do what you want...

16:22.031 --> 16:23.330
with me.

16:24.100 --> 16:25.871
I can do the same to you.

16:27.001 --> 16:27.840
I told you.

16:28.001 --> 16:28.970
I won't approve of you two.

16:29.840 --> 16:31.041
That means...

16:31.340 --> 16:32.641
I never will.

17:01.141 --> 17:02.200
Hello, Mrs. Meng.

17:02.271 --> 17:03.041
Han Yan.

17:04.741 --> 17:05.570
This is...

17:05.840 --> 17:06.810
Qin Qin, right?

17:08.411 --> 17:10.310
Mr. Chen went to pick up your brother.

17:10.781 --> 17:11.850
Today,

17:12.210 --> 17:13.351
Han Yan...

17:13.551 --> 17:14.551
will take us home.

17:15.220 --> 17:16.220
Let's get in the car.

17:17.020 --> 17:17.720
Let's go.

17:19.891 --> 17:20.821
Sister-in-law.

17:39.440 --> 17:41.040
Sister-in-law, why are you here?

17:42.651 --> 17:43.680
What did you call her?

17:44.311 --> 17:45.551
She's my brother's girlfriend.

17:45.611 --> 17:47.051
What else should I call her?

17:48.480 --> 17:50.651
Qin Qin doesn't have a boyfriend.

17:52.891 --> 17:54.161
I have a boyfriend.

17:56.131 --> 17:57.730
My boyfriend is right there.

18:03.030 --> 18:04.301
They fought.

18:04.970 --> 18:06.200
The family doesn't approve of them.

18:06.671 --> 18:07.970
They've broken up.

18:09.871 --> 18:11.040
Xu Qin.

18:11.240 --> 18:12.381
Is this your mom?

18:12.841 --> 18:14.040
Is what she said true?

18:14.210 --> 18:16.480
Are you really going to break up because of a fight?

18:30.131 --> 18:31.331
That day when it snowed,

18:32.331 --> 18:34.331
there were so many things I didn't get to tell you.

18:36.171 --> 18:37.101
I'm sorry...

18:38.571 --> 18:39.970
for only telling you this now.

18:41.671 --> 18:42.671
Song Yan.

18:44.411 --> 18:45.671
I will love you.

18:47.240 --> 18:48.440
I will love you...

18:49.611 --> 18:51.411
tomorrow, the day after tomorrow,

18:51.480 --> 18:53.821
and the rest of my life.

18:55.081 --> 18:56.020
This time,

18:58.020 --> 18:59.561
I won't let you down.

19:09.230 --> 19:10.200
I know.

19:29.091 --> 19:29.990
Hello, Mrs. Meng.

19:32.561 --> 19:33.321
Mrs. Meng.

19:33.591 --> 19:34.591
I'm in a hurry today.

19:35.061 --> 19:36.460
I'll visit you another day.

19:42.430 --> 19:43.200
Qin Qin.

19:45.770 --> 19:46.500
Mom.

19:47.440 --> 19:48.671
I have to work tomorrow.

19:49.571 --> 19:51.010
It's getting late already.

19:51.470 --> 19:53.210
I won't go home with you.

20:26.680 --> 20:28.081
Xu Qin, you're so cool.

20:28.611 --> 20:30.081
I'm impressed.

20:40.561 --> 20:41.661
It has been hard on you.

20:43.591 --> 20:45.061
It really has.

20:47.760 --> 20:48.901
The next time you go home,

20:49.161 --> 20:50.730
I'll go with you.

20:51.371 --> 20:52.671
Every time in the future,

20:53.641 --> 20:54.871
I'll go with you.

21:00.411 --> 21:01.180
I'm sorry.

21:04.450 --> 21:05.651
Did you miss me?

21:08.220 --> 21:08.950
Yes.

21:09.750 --> 21:10.891
Always.

21:13.260 --> 21:15.460
I thought I wouldn't see you before I go back today.

21:16.591 --> 21:17.591
Me too.

21:18.260 --> 21:19.131
Fortunately.

21:21.530 --> 21:22.601
Fortunately.

21:24.730 --> 21:25.970
I'm still holding on...

21:26.040 --> 21:28.141
to doughnuts and lipsticks that don't belong to me.

21:31.141 --> 21:32.440
There's a third wheel here.

21:57.601 --> 21:58.331
Hello.

21:58.571 --> 21:59.341
Hello.

21:59.970 --> 22:00.700
You're up?

22:01.540 --> 22:02.871
Why didn't you wake me before you go?

22:04.171 --> 22:05.210
I wanted you to sleep in.

22:06.440 --> 22:07.311
You must be exhausted.

22:07.680 --> 22:08.581
I'm fine.

22:09.240 --> 22:11.381
Maybe the weather's too cold.

22:12.851 --> 22:14.480
- Is it warm at home? - Yes.

22:16.290 --> 22:17.750
Can you take a day off this weekend?

22:18.351 --> 22:19.290
I can take a day off.

22:20.520 --> 22:22.321
But I still have to be on standby.

22:23.131 --> 22:23.790
Okay.

22:27.801 --> 22:28.631
Do you miss me?

22:30.500 --> 22:32.301
As much as you miss me.

22:35.270 --> 22:36.540
Well, I miss you very much.

23:00.361 --> 23:02.161
(Entrance Gates)

23:35.000 --> 23:36.131
(Yonghong Planks)

23:39.230 --> 23:40.071
Disperse!

23:40.141 --> 23:41.141
This way!

23:41.571 --> 23:43.210
This way! Disperse!

23:43.871 --> 23:45.141
Disperse! This way!

23:45.770 --> 23:46.680
This way!

23:46.980 --> 23:47.680
Go!

23:48.480 --> 23:49.510
Go!

23:55.881 --> 23:56.891
Comrades!

23:56.950 --> 23:57.821
Hurry!

23:58.690 --> 23:59.591
What's the situation?

23:59.760 --> 24:00.621
There's a fire inside.

24:00.690 --> 24:02.561
It's full of valuable planks.

24:02.730 --> 24:04.690
They're all on fire. The fire is huge.

24:04.891 --> 24:05.861
Are there any people trapped?

24:06.161 --> 24:07.561
No one's inside.

24:07.901 --> 24:09.700
I'm begging you. Do something.

24:10.871 --> 24:11.530
Yang Chi.

24:11.770 --> 24:12.601
Establish a water supply.

24:12.801 --> 24:14.371
Use two water guns to suppress the fire.

24:14.440 --> 24:15.301
Okay.

24:15.401 --> 24:16.440
- Jiang Yi. - Instructor.

24:16.770 --> 24:18.010
Check if there's a fire on the second floor.

24:18.171 --> 24:18.911
Okay.

24:19.680 --> 24:20.341
Task force.

24:20.411 --> 24:21.480
Come with me to the second floor.

24:21.581 --> 24:22.510
Yes.

25:02.421 --> 25:04.091
Make sure to put out all the fires.

25:13.631 --> 25:14.831
Check the second floor...

25:14.930 --> 25:15.730
if there's a fire.

25:16.200 --> 25:17.371
Water to the second floor.

26:00.381 --> 26:02.010
(Planks)

26:09.591 --> 26:11.091
(Planks)

26:14.121 --> 26:14.990
Instructor!

26:15.591 --> 26:16.260
Instructor!

26:25.631 --> 26:26.601
Instructor!

26:26.970 --> 26:27.770
Instructor!

26:28.871 --> 26:29.841
- Instructor! - Instructor!

26:31.641 --> 26:32.710
What's the situation on the second floor?

26:32.770 --> 26:34.680
Report your position. Are you safe?

26:34.881 --> 26:35.811
Second floor!

26:35.911 --> 26:36.581
Report!

26:36.680 --> 26:37.811
Fire detected on the second floor!

26:37.881 --> 26:39.510
We're doing our best to suppress it.

26:49.361 --> 26:50.230
Jiang Yu.

26:51.061 --> 26:51.861
Jiang Yu!

26:51.930 --> 26:53.230
- Instructor! - Wake up, Jiang Yu!

26:53.631 --> 26:54.430
Wake up.

26:55.000 --> 26:56.230
Jiang Yu! Wake up!

27:02.770 --> 27:03.770
Are you okay?

27:04.371 --> 27:05.171
Are you hurt?

27:05.571 --> 27:06.540
I'm fine.

27:08.381 --> 27:09.210
I'm fine.

27:09.851 --> 27:10.581
Upstairs, there...

27:11.250 --> 27:13.151
There are flammable and explosive materials.

27:21.260 --> 27:22.290
- Disperse! - Instructor.

27:23.331 --> 27:24.290
I'm taking you off duty.

27:25.960 --> 27:26.730
Arm.

27:26.901 --> 27:28.161
Stretcher!

27:28.230 --> 27:29.101
Pull me up.

27:29.361 --> 27:30.831
- Pull me up. - Come on.

27:33.341 --> 27:34.601
What exactly is in here?

27:36.171 --> 27:37.010
Just some...

27:37.171 --> 27:38.141
paints.

27:39.540 --> 27:40.311
And...

27:40.980 --> 27:41.740
And...

27:41.881 --> 27:43.311
And what? Tell me!

27:46.250 --> 27:47.151
Sodium chlorite.

27:50.821 --> 27:52.551
My firefighter almost died because of you.

27:53.091 --> 27:54.790
He almost died! Do you know that?

27:55.290 --> 27:56.661
Didn't you just say there are only planks?

27:58.361 --> 27:59.361
No...

27:59.901 --> 28:00.960
Calm down first.

28:01.601 --> 28:03.230
It just arrived today.

28:03.430 --> 28:04.970
I haven't had time to do the paperwork.

28:05.171 --> 28:07.071
Look. The fire is under control now.

28:07.571 --> 28:08.341
Can we let...

28:08.970 --> 28:10.970
such a trivial matter go?

28:13.881 --> 28:14.881
I mean...

28:15.480 --> 28:16.581
make an exception.

28:16.780 --> 28:17.510
Look.

28:17.651 --> 28:19.210
Mr. Xiao from your team and I...

28:19.311 --> 28:20.280
used to be classmates.

28:20.651 --> 28:21.750
You'll be legally held responsible.

28:22.321 --> 28:23.151
Wang Han Xiang!

28:23.351 --> 28:24.821
Suppress the fire!

28:26.020 --> 28:26.821
Keep fighting!

28:30.530 --> 28:31.960
Instructor, are you okay?

28:32.561 --> 28:33.460
I'm fine.

29:08.801 --> 29:09.730
Are you scared?

29:15.671 --> 29:18.240
Are you not afraid...

29:20.240 --> 29:21.180
every time you escape from death?

29:22.540 --> 29:23.280
Are you?

29:25.581 --> 29:26.651
Anyway, this time,

29:27.520 --> 29:28.621
I really got scared.

29:31.220 --> 29:32.520
What if one day,

29:33.460 --> 29:34.490
careless...

29:35.520 --> 29:36.361
and hesitation...

29:36.730 --> 29:38.561
Aren't we the ones who take care of those "what-ifs"?

29:41.361 --> 29:42.101
Training.

29:42.661 --> 29:43.500
Experience.

29:43.631 --> 29:44.500
Rescue plan.

29:45.030 --> 29:46.301
We do everything we can.

29:48.171 --> 29:49.071
If we prepare well,

29:49.571 --> 29:50.411
we won't have to worry about what-ifs.

29:51.641 --> 29:53.881
I know what our responsibilities and mission are.

29:57.111 --> 29:58.851
But I'm still afraid that one day,

29:59.851 --> 30:01.081
if we really...

30:03.051 --> 30:04.351
Who isn't afraid of death?

30:06.121 --> 30:07.561
It's just that for everyone,

30:07.990 --> 30:09.520
there's something more important than death.

30:12.960 --> 30:14.301
My former squad leader told me...

30:15.430 --> 30:16.500
that we are...

30:17.530 --> 30:19.000
the guts of this city.

30:20.071 --> 30:21.540
If even we get scared,

30:22.440 --> 30:24.341
then the hearts of this city will feel uneasy.

30:26.611 --> 30:28.040
Since I've chosen to be needed...

30:29.081 --> 30:30.411
by this city in this way,

30:32.680 --> 30:33.851
then I can't back down.

30:38.651 --> 30:39.621
If you protect others,

30:41.391 --> 30:42.391
others will protect you.

30:45.790 --> 30:47.101
My cute comrade.

30:47.901 --> 30:48.561
We...

30:49.760 --> 30:51.530
never fight alone.

31:09.020 --> 31:10.690
Why are you angry? You can talk it out.

31:10.750 --> 31:13.260
My wife was killed by your hospital.

31:14.190 --> 31:16.020
- My daughter-in-law! - Make the call.

31:17.190 --> 31:18.530
- Good morning, Dr. Xu. - Good morning.

31:18.591 --> 31:19.661
- Morning. - Good morning, Dr. Xu.

31:22.901 --> 31:23.770
What's going on out there?

31:23.831 --> 31:25.730
Yesterday, Dr. Yang saved a patient,

31:25.801 --> 31:26.970
but she didn't make it.

31:27.270 --> 31:28.401
It's not Dr. Yang's fault.

31:28.470 --> 31:29.770
The family doesn't believe it?

31:29.970 --> 31:31.540
They filed a complaint and asked for an investigation.

31:31.611 --> 31:34.341
If only they were as reasonable as you.

31:34.611 --> 31:36.111
Sooner or later,

31:36.411 --> 31:38.611
that family will camp at our hospital.

31:40.321 --> 31:41.621
Let them be.

31:41.750 --> 31:42.680
What I'm most afraid of...

31:42.750 --> 31:44.421
is that our hospital will just give them money...

31:44.490 --> 31:45.551
to bury the hatchet.

31:45.891 --> 31:46.690
I'd feel wronged.

31:46.891 --> 31:48.061
You don't have to worry about that.

31:48.121 --> 31:49.591
The boss is adamant this time.

31:49.661 --> 31:51.260
He has handed over all the information and videos...

31:51.331 --> 31:52.891
to the higher authorities.

31:52.960 --> 31:54.200
He won't compensate them.

31:54.500 --> 31:56.230
If this sets a precedent and they all come to scam us,

31:56.301 --> 31:57.571
what will become of our hospital?

31:57.730 --> 31:58.530
A bank?

31:59.000 --> 31:59.831
That's right.

32:00.071 --> 32:01.470
If Dr. Yang compensates them,

32:01.540 --> 32:03.071
doesn't that mean she admits to harming someone?

32:10.611 --> 32:11.680
Let's get to work.

33:01.161 --> 33:02.530
When I was abroad,

33:03.371 --> 33:04.901
I knew an ER doctor.

33:05.970 --> 33:07.571
He made a rule for himself.

33:08.871 --> 33:10.371
If the patient failed to be resuscitated...

33:10.970 --> 33:12.071
and didn't make it off the operating table,

33:13.480 --> 33:14.581
he'd set a timer...

33:16.311 --> 33:17.980
and only let himself be sad for a minute.

33:18.480 --> 33:19.680
Not a second longer.

33:21.421 --> 33:22.720
You've been sad for a long time.

33:27.460 --> 33:28.661
The doctor you know...

33:29.861 --> 33:31.061
is a lot like you.

33:32.460 --> 33:33.831
Some people think he's cold-blooded...

33:34.430 --> 33:35.230
and heartless.

33:36.970 --> 33:37.770
But he said...

33:38.700 --> 33:39.970
it's the ER doctor's responsibility...

33:40.641 --> 33:42.171
not to be sad for more than a minute.

33:43.970 --> 33:45.841
Because there are many other patients waiting for you.

33:53.010 --> 33:53.851
You know what?

33:54.651 --> 33:56.690
Today, I kept thinking about what you said.

33:59.421 --> 34:01.290
You said you don't need to be thanked for saving lives.

34:02.260 --> 34:03.861
Medicine is just science.

34:04.331 --> 34:05.391
It has its limitations.

34:06.290 --> 34:07.131
As for being a doctor,

34:07.530 --> 34:08.730
it's just a profession.

34:09.901 --> 34:11.030
It has its boundaries.

34:11.901 --> 34:12.831
I kept thinking.

34:14.141 --> 34:15.071
Again and again.

34:18.341 --> 34:20.011
I'm actually a little envious of your attitude.

34:25.511 --> 34:26.511
But I can't be like that.

34:30.350 --> 34:31.721
That was what I thought before.

34:32.850 --> 34:34.091
I have my biases too.

34:38.460 --> 34:39.531
Look at us.

34:39.890 --> 34:40.830
We...

34:41.901 --> 34:43.160
one is in heaven, and the other is in hell.

34:43.600 --> 34:44.431
Quick, help her!

34:47.741 --> 34:48.540
Put her head to the side.

34:50.440 --> 34:51.140
Monitor her.

34:51.440 --> 34:52.471
Establish an IV line.

34:53.381 --> 34:54.241
- Where's her family? - They're outside.

34:54.310 --> 34:55.241
- Tell them to come in. - Okay.

35:07.361 --> 35:08.160
Dr. Yang.

35:08.290 --> 35:09.120
Dr. Yang.

35:09.361 --> 35:10.261
Her family is here.

35:10.861 --> 35:11.730
Who are you?

35:11.861 --> 35:13.431
I'm her husband. This is my mom.

35:13.960 --> 35:15.330
Your wife has upper gastrointestinal bleeding.

35:15.401 --> 35:17.230
She's in critical condition and needs surgery immediately.

35:17.500 --> 35:18.471
You have to make a decision.

35:18.770 --> 35:19.701
Doctor.

35:20.201 --> 35:21.370
How much will it cost?

35:22.671 --> 35:23.540
A few thousand.

35:24.011 --> 35:24.910
How much exactly?

35:24.971 --> 35:26.140
She usually has a stomachache at home too.

35:26.210 --> 35:27.210
Is it that serious?

35:27.511 --> 35:28.810
I'm not joking around.

35:28.980 --> 35:30.281
You have to make a decision right now.

35:31.651 --> 35:32.410
Doctor.

35:32.480 --> 35:33.381
Is there a way...

35:33.651 --> 35:35.020
not to undergo surgery?

35:35.151 --> 35:36.520
For example, put her on a drip...

35:36.721 --> 35:37.850
or get an IV or something.

35:38.020 --> 35:39.321
Ma'am, let me put it this way.

35:39.451 --> 35:41.491
If she doesn't get help now, she's 100 percent dead.

35:41.690 --> 35:43.390
But if she does, there's still a ten percent chance to live.

35:43.991 --> 35:45.330
A ten percent chance?

35:45.890 --> 35:47.531
For tens of thousands of yuan?

35:47.600 --> 35:48.401
Ma'am.

35:48.830 --> 35:50.401
That's not how it works.

35:50.730 --> 35:51.931
It's a life we're talking about.

35:52.000 --> 35:52.971
Doctor.

35:53.401 --> 35:54.870
How about this? Mom.

35:55.000 --> 35:56.741
Can we discuss this further?

35:56.841 --> 35:57.770
Discuss.

35:59.011 --> 36:00.381
We'll discuss it first.

36:01.640 --> 36:02.640
Make it quick.

36:05.051 --> 36:06.080
Hurry up.

36:09.951 --> 36:10.750
Mom.

36:11.750 --> 36:13.051
Let's just pay up.

36:13.151 --> 36:14.821
Pay what? You silly boy.

36:14.890 --> 36:16.160
She hasn't given birth to a child yet.

36:16.261 --> 36:18.131
Mom, we've been together for so many years.

36:18.491 --> 36:19.330
Are you stupid?

36:19.460 --> 36:20.901
It's tens of thousands of yuan.

36:21.401 --> 36:22.701
- Listen to me. - Where are they?

36:22.901 --> 36:25.000
- Have you made up your mind? - Doctor.

36:25.571 --> 36:27.100
I'm asking you now. Are you going to save her or not?

36:27.171 --> 36:28.370
Hurry up. There's no time to lose.

36:28.440 --> 36:29.741
- Brother-in-law. - This...

36:29.971 --> 36:30.870
Brother-in-law.

36:32.210 --> 36:33.011
How's Rong Rong?

36:33.580 --> 36:35.410
- You are... - I'm her brother.

36:35.781 --> 36:37.511
Your sister is in critical condition.

36:37.710 --> 36:39.080
If you save her immediately, there's still hope.

36:39.310 --> 36:40.451
I need your decision now.

36:40.750 --> 36:41.480
Are you going to save her or not?

36:41.681 --> 36:43.250
Save her. Definitely.

36:45.620 --> 36:46.520
Come with me to sign the paperwork.

36:47.460 --> 36:48.190
Go.

37:47.850 --> 37:49.221
I saw the surgery record.

37:49.520 --> 37:50.451
You didn't do anything wrong.

37:51.051 --> 37:52.020
It's not your fault.

37:56.690 --> 37:59.361
But it's true that she died in my hands.

38:03.401 --> 38:04.531
I just don't get it.

38:06.531 --> 38:08.671
Why did something like this have to happen to me?

38:11.471 --> 38:13.270
Why did she have to die in my hands?

38:17.881 --> 38:19.881
Maybe it's God's way of telling us...

38:22.881 --> 38:24.221
that we're just weak people.

38:25.250 --> 38:26.350
We're not almighty gods.

39:15.870 --> 39:16.841
Listen.

39:17.410 --> 39:20.171
Ever since you got transferred to the fire station,

39:20.881 --> 39:21.781
I, your mom,

39:21.841 --> 39:24.111
never got a good night's sleep.

39:25.410 --> 39:26.951
You and Dad don't have to worry.

39:27.080 --> 39:28.080
Our fire station...

39:28.281 --> 39:30.051
has very good safety measures.

39:30.250 --> 39:31.821
And our operations are very standard.

39:32.491 --> 39:34.321
If so, why did the incident happen?

39:34.861 --> 39:36.120
You're going to lose your life.

39:36.491 --> 39:38.330
You're in hot water every day.

39:38.390 --> 39:40.091
How can I not worry?

39:41.031 --> 39:42.031
It's too dangerous.

39:42.201 --> 39:43.401
Don't worry.

39:43.901 --> 39:44.971
Don't lose sleep over it.

39:45.971 --> 39:47.241
Is the reason you can't sleep...

39:47.370 --> 39:48.870
because Dad has made you mad lately?

39:49.870 --> 39:50.770
We're talking about you.

39:51.540 --> 39:52.440
Why drag me into this?

39:53.171 --> 39:54.640
You say something.

39:54.710 --> 39:56.440
Aren't you worried too?

39:56.511 --> 39:57.250
Yes.

39:57.710 --> 39:58.611
At first,

39:59.210 --> 40:00.451
I didn't really support him.

40:00.821 --> 40:02.281
But now, it's the other way around.

40:02.681 --> 40:04.551
One can't give up halfway.

40:05.051 --> 40:05.790
Yes.

40:05.850 --> 40:07.491
Look at him now.

40:07.660 --> 40:09.091
He looks much more...

40:09.660 --> 40:10.761
like a responsible person now.

40:11.390 --> 40:12.330
It's all thanks...

40:12.390 --> 40:14.160
to his experience at the fire station.

40:14.361 --> 40:15.460
I think it's fine.

40:15.761 --> 40:17.500
But be careful.

40:18.330 --> 40:19.131
Thank you, Dad.

40:19.801 --> 40:21.341
Only you can say the nice things, is that right?

40:22.370 --> 40:23.171
Then you say some too.

40:26.671 --> 40:27.611
Listen up.

40:28.381 --> 40:31.250
Be careful.

40:31.480 --> 40:33.210
Mom, don't worry.

40:39.690 --> 40:41.290
Ma'am, talk to him.

40:42.790 --> 40:43.830
Bad news!

40:43.890 --> 40:45.160
That man and his mom are going to jump!

40:45.230 --> 40:46.591
They're on the roof of the Outpatient Center!

40:46.690 --> 40:47.401
Who?

40:47.500 --> 40:49.230
Who else? Li Rong's family.

40:50.031 --> 40:51.031
It's one thing after another.

40:51.100 --> 40:52.301
There's no end to it.

40:52.701 --> 40:54.301
I think they definitely won't jump.

40:54.370 --> 40:55.270
The more scene they make, the more likely they won't jump.

40:55.341 --> 40:56.901
- Let's go and take a look. - No.

40:56.971 --> 40:58.341
What if they really jump?

40:58.410 --> 41:00.071
The police and ambulance are here.

41:00.140 --> 41:01.511
Let's save them first.

41:26.301 --> 41:28.640
They killed my daughter-in-law!

41:32.611 --> 41:33.341
What's the situation?

41:33.440 --> 41:34.440
Someone wants to jump off the building.

41:34.681 --> 41:36.080
We've been trying to stop them, but they wouldn't listen.

41:36.241 --> 41:37.151
- They won't let anyone near. - Listen up!

41:37.210 --> 41:39.011
You can't go to hospitals anymore!

41:39.250 --> 41:40.051
Yang Chi.

41:40.281 --> 41:41.080
Take a team upstairs.

41:41.681 --> 41:43.151
- Prepare the air mattress. - Got it.

41:44.051 --> 41:44.750
Okay.

41:44.921 --> 41:46.250
Come on.

41:51.690 --> 41:52.361
Let's go.
